# SoundTaskbar agent rules

1. At the start of every session, read `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` before coding.
2. Before context runs out or after a major milestone, update `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` sections «Текущее состояние» and «Следующие шаги», then commit.
3. Commit messages: lowercase, no trailing period, one short sentence.
   Example: `add smtc session reader skeleton`
4. Keep scope tight to the latest user request.
5. Product goal: taskbar media controls for music/video — artwork, title, prev/play/next, duration, per-source volume.
